p.src:
For the expectation-value calculations, solve Equation  for the two time derivatives: $\begin{aligned}
\dot{\psi}
&=
\frac{i\hbar}{2m}\psi''
-\frac{i}{\hbar}V\psi,
\\
\dot{\psi}^{\,*}
&=
-\frac{i\hbar}{2m}\psi^{*\,\prime\prime}
+\frac{i}{\hbar}V\psi^*.
\end{aligned}$ The second line is only the complex conjugate of the first, but writing both makes the cancellations visible.

